# anthropic_vault (Resource)

Creates and manages a vault that securely stores MCP credentials for use by Anthropic Managed Agent sessions (beta). Vaults are billed only at runtime when credentials are accessed during an agent session.

> **API**: `POST/GET/POST/DELETE /v1/vaults[/{id}]` (Managed Agents API).
> **Auth**: Standard API key (`api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: `anthropic-beta: managed-agents-2026-04-01`.
> **Cost**: Free for management, billable at runtime when credentials are used.

